{"id":"n30203-1-19","stage":0,"title":"강 · 江、河","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30203-1-19-1","ko":"주말에 뭐 할 생각인가?","zh":"周末有什么打算吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"생각인가?","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각인가","audio":"/audio/0866f1e5c7b682ccaa57.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/10f3c92676a72b4a9592.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30203-1-19-2","ko":"조용히 강에서 낚시나 좀 할까 해요.","zh":"打算在河边静静地钓会儿鱼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地。","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}},{"text":"강에서","meaning":"在河边","explanation":"강：河、江；-에서 表示动作发生的地方。","readings":[{"term":"강","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30203","senseId":"1","lemma":"강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강에서","audio":"/audio/aa65bc5936d8ea94779b.mp3"}},{"text":"낚시나","meaning":"钓鱼之类的","explanation":"낚시：钓鱼；-나 使提议显得随意，表示“钓钓鱼之类的”。","readings":[{"term":"낚시","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56098","senseId":"2","lemma":"낚시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낚시나","audio":"/audio/29009c63c29f3711fd55.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：表示程度或时间不多；这里让说法更随意。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"할까","meaning":"做做看","explanation":"하다：做；-ㄹ까 与后面的 하다 合用，表示正考虑这样做。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까","audio":"/audio/8f972208798a5637049f.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"打算","explanation":"-ㄹ까 하다 表示正在考虑或打算做某事；-아요 是礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"静静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"安静、不吵闹地；这里形容清静地钓鱼。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"d90ed2084b71f17c","term":"강","zh":"江，河","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3","entryId":"30203","definition":"又宽又长、最后流入大海的水流。","pronunciation":["강"]},{"id":"997b7b3d44815df9","term":"낚시","zh":"钓鱼","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3","entryId":"56098","definition":"用钓具捕鱼。","pronunciation":["낙씨"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"稍微、一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"表示程度或时间不多；这里使钓鱼计划显得轻松随意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eaced89f8c55d4b0e016.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30203","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2401,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["打算在河边静静地钓会儿鱼。","饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？","周末有什么打算吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["打算在河边静静地钓会儿鱼。","周末有什么打算吗？","饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？"],"answer":0}]}
